# GitHub Linguist Language Detection Overrides
# Documentation: https://github.com/github-linguist/linguist/blob/master/docs/overrides.md

# The standalone portfolio (index.html) embeds 51 base64 images (~8.9 MB) for offline viewing.
# Exclude HTML from repository language calculation so Python correctly shows as the primary language (~100%).
index.html linguist-detectable=false
index.html linguist-generated=true
index.html linguist-documentation=true
*.html linguist-detectable=false
